                            {
                                "edit": {
                                    "fields": [
                                        {
                                            "field": "context",
                                            "value": "Proceed only after favorable review of AR-moving-field. Implement the approved coupling schedule and paired impulse/work interfaces; keep ports closed and omit active biology and full species transport. Use simulation-health via .mindgraph/project_capabilities/simulation-health.md and references/simulation-health-diagnostics.md under .agents/skills/bitloop-development. This task delivers focused passive integration, rollback, and cost checks; T-passive-qualification separately evaluates repeated-cycle/refinement feasibility before downstream species/resource/activity work."
                                        }
                                    ],
