            "observation": "User-requested planning work: \"I'd rather try to replace the current plan fresh with a fresh run rather than migration, so I can test it's still producing a plan equally good (if not better).\" The user authorized updating the local planner/reviewer instructions and schemas, regenerating from Substrate VISION.md via Codex, and repeating generation while ensuring the existing Task DAG does not regress. Artifact information should be prepared now, without implementing visual layers. No implementation or physical experiments have been run for this new plan. The review question contains the assistant's assessment of the plan structure, not a human-reported experimental observation.",
